<p>    OPSM Protector		    7.50 cents</p>
<p>    Pacific Dunlop		    3.00 cents</p>
<p>    Scott Corporation		 5.00 cents</p>
<p>    Spicers Paper		     5.50 cents</p>
<p>    Tyndall Australia		 2.50 cents</p>
<p>    United Overseas Australia     2.00 cents</p>
<p>    Western Metals		    1.00 cents</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
